Z||000001||Bugsy||12-17-2001||06:25 PM||||I believe front wheel drive wheels were designed to better ventilate the axles and rotors on a front wheel drive car....the Fiero is designed like a front wheel drive, the only difference is that the wheels don't turn, my local tire store told me not to put aftermarket wheels on my fiero unless they were designed for front wheel drive.<P>------------------<BR>86 SE I'm addicted and proud of it<BR>Kevin||||reg||6
